sentation-and-interview/\"><span>49</span><span data-bn=\"Portfolio Presentation ও Interview Walkthrough\" data-en=\"Portfolio Presentation and Interview Walkthrough\">Portfolio Presentation and Interview Walkthrough</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-analytics-workflows/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-analytics-workflows/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-analytics-workflows/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-analytics-workflows/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"clean-dataset-handoff\" data-tutorial=\"data-analytics-workflows\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Quality and Preparation · Chapter 19 / 49\" data-en=\"Data Quality and Preparation · Chapter 19 of 49\">Data Quality and Preparation · Chapter 19 of 49</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Clean Dataset Handoff তৈরি\" data-en=\"Create a Clean Dataset Handoff\">Create a Clean Dataset Handoff</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Clean Dataset Handoff তৈরি ব্যবহার করে complete analytics workflow-এ reproducible ও decision-ready output তৈরির পদ্ধতি শিখুন।\" data-en=\"A clean handoff includes the prepared data, dictionary, quality report, transformation notes, refresh instructions, known limitations, and responsible owner. Clean does not mean perfect; it means fit for the stated purpose with documented exceptions.\">A clean handoff includes the prepared data, dictionary, quality report, transformation notes, refresh instructions, known limitations, and responsible owner. Clean does not mean perfect; it means fit for the stated purpose with documented exceptions.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 45 min</span><span>Intermediate</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"সহজ ভাষায় Clean Dataset Handoff তৈরি explain করে end-to-end analytics project-এর সঙ্গে connect করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain Create a Clean Dataset Handoff in plain language and connect it to an end-to-end analytics project.\">Explain Create a Clean Dataset Handoff in plain language and connect it to an end-to-end analytics project.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"একটি বাস্তব retail sales performance case-এ Clean Dataset Handoff তৈরি apply করুন।\" data-en=\"Apply Create a Clean Dataset Handoff to a realistic retail sales performance case.\">Apply Create a Clean Dataset Handoff to a realistic retail sales performance case.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Required evidence, control ও deliverable identify করুন।\" data-en=\"Identify the required evidence, controls, and deliverables.\">Identify the required evidence, controls, and deliverables.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"একটি limitation এবং একটি decision-ready next step লিখুন।\" data-en=\"State one limitation and one decision-ready next step.\">State one limitation and one decision-ready next step.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Clean Dataset Handoff তৈরি কী\" data-en=\"What Create a Clean Dataset Handoff means\">What Create a Clean Dataset Handoff means</h2><p data-bn=\"Clean Dataset Handoff তৈরি একটি complete analytics project-এর গুরুত্বপূর্ণ অংশ। এই stage-এ decision, data grain, definition, assumption এবং expected output স্পষ্টভাবে লিখতে হবে, যাতে অন্য reviewer evidence inspect করে একই logic বুঝতে পারেন।\" data-en=\"A clean handoff includes the prepared data, dictionary, quality report, transformation notes, refresh instructions, known limitations, and responsible owner. Clean does not mean perfect; it means fit for the stated purpose with documented exceptions. In a complete analytics project, this stage must leave visible evidence that another reviewer can inspect. The analyst should state the decision, data grain, definitions, assumptions, and expected output rather than relying on memory or undocumented discussion.\">A clean handoff includes the prepared data, dictionary, quality report, transformation notes, refresh instructions, known limitations, and responsible owner. Clean does not mean perfect; it means fit for the stated purpose with documented exceptions. In a complete analytics project, this stage must leave visible evidence that another reviewer can inspect. The analyst should state the decision, data grain, definitions, assumptions, and expected output rather than relying on memory or undocumented discussion.</p><div class=\"formula-block\"><span>Workflow</span><code>Question → Data → Quality → Analysis → Validation → Insight → Action\nFocus: Create a Clean Dataset Handoff</code><button aria-label=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy-code\" data-copy-code=\"\" type=\"button\">Copy</button></div></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Analyst কীভাবে apply করেন\" data-en=\"How an analyst applies it\">How an analyst applies it</h2><p data-bn=\"retail sales performance case-এ analyst এই step-কে regional revenue, profit, and product mix-এর সঙ্গে connect করেন। Output project charter, data dictionary, analysis plan, validation log, report অথবা repository-তে record করতে হবে, যাতে Excel, SQL, Power BI ও Python-এ reuse করা যায়।\" data-en=\"Package the analytical dataset so another analyst can reproduce the next stage without guessing how it was created. In the retail sales performance case, the analyst connects this step to regional revenue, profit, and product mix. The output is recorded in the project charter, data dictionary, analysis plan, validation log, report, or repository so it can be reused across Excel, SQL, Power BI, and Python.\">Package the analytical dataset so another analyst can reproduce the next stage without guessing how it was created. In the retail sales performance case, the analyst connects this step to regional revenue, profit, and product mix. The output is recorded in the project charter, data dictionary, analysis plan, validation log, report, or repository so it can be reused across Excel, SQL, Power BI, and Python.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Control, mistake ও completion evidence\" data-en=\"Controls, mistakes, and completion evidence\">Controls, mistakes, and completion evidence</h2><p data-bn=\"Common mistake হলো preferred tool দিয়ে শুরু করা, project চলাকালে definition বদলানো, excluded record না লেখা, unreconciled total accept করা এবং evidence-এর চেয়ে বড় conclusion দেওয়া। Completion প্রমাণ করতে named artifact, owner, validation result ও documented limitation প্রয়োজন।\" data-en=\"Common failures include beginning with a preferred tool, changing definitions mid-project, omitting excluded records, accepting unreconciled totals, and writing conclusions that exceed the evidence. Completion should be demonstrated with a named artifact, an owner, a validation result, and a documented limitation—not only a verbal claim that the step is finished.\">Common failures include beginning with a preferred tool, changing definitions mid-project, omitting excluded records, accepting unreconciled totals, and writing conclusions that exceed the evidence. Completion should be demonstrated with a named artifact, an owner, a validation result, and a documented limitation—not only a verbal claim that the step is finished.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Handoff\" data-en=\"Handoff\">Handoff</h3><p data-bn=\"Handoff: Transfer of an asset and its supporting context. Project context-এ term-টির exact meaning ও evidence লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Transfer of an asset and its supporting context.\">Transfer of an asset and its supporting context.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Fitness for use\" data-en=\"Fitness for use\">Fitness for use</h3><p data-bn=\"Fitness for use: Suitability for a defined analytical purpose. Project context-এ term-টির exact meaning ও evidence লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Suitability for a defined analytical purpose.\">Suitability for a defined analytical purpose.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Known issue\" data-en=\"Known issue\">Known issue</h3><p data-bn=\"Known issue: Documented unresolved limitation. Project context-এ term-টির exact meaning ও evidence লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Documented unresolved limitation.\">Documented unresolved limitation.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Refresh instruction\" data-en=\"Refresh instruction\">Refresh instruction</h3><p data-bn=\"Refresh instruction: Procedure for updating the dataset. Project context-এ term-টির exact meaning ও evidence লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Procedure for updating the dataset.\">Procedure for updating the dataset.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Worked example: retail sales performance-এর জন্য Clean Dataset Handoff তৈরি\" data-en=\"Worked example: Create a Clean Dataset Handoff for retail sales performance\">Worked example: Create a Clean Dataset Handoff for retail sales performance</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"একজন Data Analyst final decision deliverable তৈরির আগে synthetic retail sales performance project-এ Clean Dataset Handoff তৈরি apply করবেন।\" data-en=\"A Data Analyst must apply create a clean dataset handoff to a synthetic retail sales performance project before producing the final decision deliverable.\">A Data Analyst must apply create a clean dataset handoff to a synthetic retail sales performance project before producing the final decision deliverable.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Stakeholder decision, project boundary ও row grain আবার লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Restate the stakeholder decision, project boundary, and row grain.\">Restate the stakeholder decision, project boundary, and row grain.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"regional revenue, profit, and product mix-এর জন্য exact evidence identify করুন।\" data-en=\"Identify the exact evidence required for regional revenue, profit, and product mix.\">Identify the exact evidence required for regional revenue, profit, and product mix.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Chosen tool-এ step perform করে validation check record করুন।\" data-en=\"Perform the step in the chosen tool and record a validation check.\">Perform the step in the chosen tool and record a validation check.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Project log-এ result, limitation, owner ও next action লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Write the result, limitation, owner, and next action in the project log.\">Write the result, limitation, owner, and next action in the project log.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Clean Dataset Handoff তৈরি তখনই complete, যখন project artifact, validation evidence ও decision context consistent।\" data-en=\"Create a Clean Dataset Handoff is complete only when the project artifact, validation evidence, and decision context agree.\">Create a Clean Dataset Handoff is complete only when the project artifact, validation evidence, and decision context agree.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-analytics-workflows/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Clean Dataset Handoff তৈরি decision ও evidence-এর সঙ্গে যুক্ত থাকতে হবে।\" data-en=\"A clean handoff includes the prepared data, dictionary, quality report, transformation notes, refresh instructions, known limitations, and responsible owner.\">A clean handoff includes the prepared data, dictionary, quality report, transformation notes, refresh instructions, known limitations, and responsible owner.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Row grain, definition, assumption ও owner লিখুন।\" data-en=\"State the row grain, definitions, assumptions, and owner.\">State the row grain, definitions, assumptions, and owner.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Validation evidence ও known limitation সংরক্ষণ করুন।\" data-en=\"Retain validation evidence and known limitations.\">Retain validation evidence and known limitations.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Output দিয়ে specific next action support করুন।\" data-en=\"Use the output to support a specific next action.\">Use the output to support a specific next action.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/spss-modeler/18.6.0?topic=dm-crisp-help-overview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IBM CRISP-DM overview ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section1/eda11.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST Exploratory Data Analysis ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-analytics-workflows/transformation-lineage-and-audit-trail/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Transformation Lineage ও Audit Trail\" data-en=\"Transformation Lineage and Audit Trails\">Transformation Lineage and Audit Trails</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-analytics-workflows/analysis-plan-and-evidence-map/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Analysis Plan ও Evidence Map\" data-en=\"Analysis Plans and Evidence Maps\">Analysis Plans and Evidence Maps</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}